D2C E-commerce Website Blueprint: CAPSHOT (SHI-28)

Objective: To build a high-converting, mobile-optimized D2C e-commerce landing page that educates customers about our unique cap-shot technology and drives instant sales.

🛠️ Recommended Platform & Technical Setup

• Platform: Shopify (Highly recommended for seamless order management and shipping integrations).
• Payment Gateways: Integration with Razorpay or PhonePe Payment Gateway (Must support UPI, Credit/Debit Cards, Net Banking, and automated Cash on Delivery (COD) configuration).
• Shipping Integration: Shiprocket or Delhivery API integration for automated order tracking and shipping label generation.
• Core Goal: Extreme mobile optimization. 95% of traffic will be from smartphones (via Instagram/Facebook Ads).

